      "content": "rest feels impossible though. even when i'm doing nothing, i can feel the weight of it. it's like there's no real escape from it. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to not have to be \"on\" anymore. it feels like there's no version of life where this doesn't eventually just wear me down to nothing.",
